Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 21:34:03 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(ui): drop the Google Fonts links from index.html

The stylesheet is render blocking and the host is unreachable from a
closed contour. Roboto Flex and Sora are only used on the signing pages
and both declarations already fall back to sans-serif.

Also close head before the title instead of after it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UX8GBrH8Jb7eacj7Pj9hKi
---
 cvat-ui/src/index.html | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/cvat-ui/src/index.html b/cvat-ui/src/index.html
index 4287cdba5..eecaf82e7 100644
--- a/cvat-ui/src/index.html
+++ b/cvat-ui/src/index.html
@@ -16,9 +16,6 @@
             name="description"
             content="Computer Vision Annotation Tool (CVAT) is a free, open source, web-based image and video annotation tool which is used for labeling data for computer vision algorithms. CVAT supports the primary tasks of supervised machine learning: object detection, image classification, and image segmentation. CVAT allows users to annotate data for each of these cases"
         />
-        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
-        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
-        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto+Flex:opsz,wght@8..144,400;8..144,500;8..144,600;8..144,700;8..144,800&family=Sora&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">    </head>
         <title>Computer Vision Annotation Tool</title>
     </head>
     <body translate="no">
